/* 1 is the app icon: Explorer, Alt-Tab, the exe file itself. Explorer takes the
   first group in this table, so it has to stay first.
   2 and 3 are the tray icon in one colour, chosen at run time by whether the
   taskbar is dark or light. */
1 ICON "picline.ico"
2 ICON "picline-tray-on-dark.ico"
3 ICON "picline-tray-on-light.ico"
